# docs/ is version-controlled, but only Markdown documentation is tracked.
#
# Everything else here stays on local disk only: the demo deck and its
# generator (artifacts/), the Python virtualenv (venv/), the .env template,
# and any other non-Markdown files. Their content is captured in
# COMPREHENSIVE-GUIDE.md, so nothing is lost from version control.

# Ignore everything by default...
*
# ...but let git descend into subdirectories...
!*/
# ...and keep Markdown docs plus this ignore file.
!*.md
!.gitignore

# Never track the build virtualenv (it contains vendored *.md files that the
# whitelist above would otherwise pick up).
venv/
